:====
# A recursive function binds the stack-local from its own read of it, and returns from inside
# the binding.

+ @stack depth = 1

-- find(3)
-- depth

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do find Int
    - n Int

do with depth = depth + n
    if n == 0
        = depth
    = find(n - 1)

:----

7
1
